sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as transfer-service
    participant R as risk-service
    participant A as account-service

    Note over T,A: Alice to Mallory, 75.00 USD. Mallory is on the watchlist.
    T->>R: EXECUTE RESERVE_LIMIT
    R-->>T: DONE
    T->>A: EXECUTE DEBIT_SOURCE
    A-->>T: DONE (Alice -75.00)
    T->>A: EXECUTE CREDIT_DESTINATION
    A-->>T: DONE (Mallory +75.00)
    T->>R: EXECUTE CLEAR_TRANSFER
    R-->>T: REJECTED, destination on the watchlist
    Note over T,R: status COMPENSATING, undo in reverse order
    T->>A: COMPENSATE CREDIT_DESTINATION
    A-->>T: DONE (Mallory -75.00)
    T->>A: COMPENSATE DEBIT_SOURCE
    A-->>T: DONE (Alice +75.00)
    T->>R: COMPENSATE RESERVE_LIMIT
    R-->>T: DONE (reservation released)
    Note over T,R: status COMPENSATED, both balances unchanged
